Sakina (sa) Bibi Ke Lab Par Sada Hai.<br>
qudaya Waqt Kaisa Aa Pada Hai.<br>
mera Baba Akela Hogaya Hai.<br>
ali Akbar Asws. Bhi Ran Mein Mar Chuke Hai.<br>
chacha Shane Katakar Sogaye Hai.<br>
faqat Bhaiya Qaime Mein Bacha Hai.<br>
<br>
yeh Sunke Hogaye Jhoole Mein Muztar.<br>
kaha Ye Bezubani Mein Ay Qwahar.<br>
tere Bhayi Ka Marna Reh Gaya.<br>
<br>
<br>
ali Asghar Asws. Bhi Ran Ko Jaa Raha Hai.<br>
sakina (sa) Bibi Ke Lab Par Sada Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
1. Ajab Hai Karbala Ka Ye Sipahi.<br>
na Tan Par Hai Zira Aur Na Sawari.<br>
anokhi Shaan Se Wo Jaa Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Teri In Nargisi Aankho'n Ke Sadqe.<br>
nazar Lag Jaye Na Bhaiya Ko Mere.<br>
mere Maa'njaaya Sajke Jaa Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Tujhe Ek Baar Jhoole Mein Jhulalu.<br>
tujhe Mai Apne Seene Se Lagalu.<br>
mujhe Kyu Rona Rona Aa Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Meri Amma Balayein Iski Lelo.<br>
nazar Ka Teeka Bhi Isko Lagado.<br>
yeh Pehli Baar Maqtal Jaa Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Tere Bin Kaise Jee Payegi Madar.<br>
sukoo'n Se So Bhi Na Paayegi Madar.<br>
ke Uska Laadla Bhi Jaa Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Lagega Teer Nazuk Se Gale Par.<br>
na Qatra Pani Ka Hoga Mayassar.<br>
mujhe Kyu Aisa Bhaiya Lag Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Shahe Dee'n Qaime Mein Maida'n Se Aaye.<br>
jhukakar Sar Sakina (sa) Se Ye Bole.<br>
tere Bhayi Ka Manka Dhal Chula Hai.<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Likha Hai (moosvi) Tune Jo Nauha.<br>
duayein Deti Hai Bali Sakina (sa)<br>
jo Iske Bhayi Par Tu Ro Raha Hai.<br>
<br>
